{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{3}⁡\\theta .$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor $\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta $ from the expression:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{3}⁡\\theta =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot ({sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta )\n$$\n\nThen, we use ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =1$ to simplify the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot ({sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{3}⁡\\theta =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335815 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1332c368-ca92-598a-b017-c6a38e37515b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333159} {:answer/id #uuid "3b440461-a311-58f9-97a9-e236f18955f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333549} {:answer/id #uuid "3d865c4f-b7d6-59c6-af49-bc32692c8d3d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333566} {:answer/id #uuid "ccf29d01-df1f-5592-a1cc-d38d9953cc72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334777} {:answer/id #uuid "ed815fda-1d0c-57d0-91b5-495efb2c04b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335073}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ed815fda-1d0c-57d0-91b5-495efb2c04b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335073} :answer-field/id #uuid "c40ac1a1-